{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/champ_0260.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/champ_0260.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0260_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "CDAA7F23946301ED",
      "text": "回不去了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0260_system_01",
      "hash64": "9E275C92DC34CA97",
      "text": "要挑战冠军测验的最终测验吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_01",
      "hash64": "E8583ABB962011C9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，欢迎你。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_02",
      "hash64": "E85837BB96200CB0",
      "text": "能在宝可梦联盟的顶点\\n再次见到你，\\r\\n真是令人高兴。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_03",
      "hash64": "E85838BB96200E63",
      "text": "最终测验的内容就是和\\n身为首席冠军的也慈我对战。\\r\\n……只要打赢我，你就能通过测验。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_04",
      "hash64": "E8583DBB962016E2",
      "text": "不过，在那之前，\\n我想先和你道个歉。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_05",
      "hash64": "E8583EBB96201895",
      "text": "我身为联盟会长\\n有个不好的缺点……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "E8583BBB9620137C",
      "text": "那就是对于宝可梦对战，\\n我无法做出任何妥协。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_07",
      "hash64": "E8583CBB9620152F",
      "text": "或许就是因为这样，最近完全\\n没人能通过测验，让我很伤脑筋。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_08",
      "hash64": "E85841BB96201DAE",
      "text": "不过，如果是你的话，\\n或许能像冠军妮莫一样，\\r\\n完成惊人的壮举。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_09",
      "hash64": "E85842BB96201F61",
      "text": "那么，你都准备好了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_10",
      "hash64": "E85BBFBB9623299F",
      "text": "你的才能……\\n就让我一探究竟吧。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_11",
      "hash64": "E85BBEBB962327EC",
      "text": "……你的实力相当出众，\\n漂亮的招式层出不穷。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_12",
      "hash64": "E85BC1BB96232D05",
      "text": "帕底亚地区又诞生了\\n一位伟大的训练家。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_13",
      "hash64": "E85BC0BB96232B52",
      "text": "恭喜你。\\n新的冠军[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0260_ground_01",
      "hash64": "02BFD851255BE7F1",
      "text": "这次我真的能恭喜你啦！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0260_steel_01a",
      "hash64": "4281B21F1F61DC74",
      "text": "哇～！大哥哥！\\n你干得太棒啦～！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "champ_0260_steel_01b",
      "hash64": "4281B51F1F61E18D",
      "text": "哇～！大姐姐！\\n你干得太棒啦～！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "champ_0260_fly_01",
      "hash64": "78708B24B925FA97",
      "text": "……恭喜。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "champ_0260_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "070EEC45DBEA75B9",
      "text": "太……太漂亮了！！\\n小生被你深深地感动了！！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "champ_0260_ground_02",
      "hash64": "02BFD551255BE2D8",
      "text": "哎呀，又哭了……[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_14",
      "hash64": "E85BBBBB962322D3",
      "text": "各位宝可梦训练家\\n都是我们帕底亚地区的瑰宝……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "E85BBABB96232120",
      "text": "在那当中，冠军则是\\n更为耀眼的存在。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "E85BBDBB96232639",
      "text": "冠军[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "E85BBCBB96232486",
      "text": "请你以身作则，引领帕底亚的\\n训练家们向前迈进吧。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "E85BC7BB96233737",
      "text": "好了，\\n我送你到入口处吧。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "E85BC6BB96233584",
      "text": "一定会有个和你很熟的同学\\n在那里盼着见到你呢。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
